<title>FRANCE: C. Agricole sees rise in 1996 profits.</title>
<headline>C. Agricole sees rise in 1996 profits.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole expects to show a rise in profits in 1996, managing director Lucien Douroux said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the difficult environment, we will have a further rise in our 1996 results after a profit of 6.5 billion francs in 1995,&quot; he told a conference.</p>
<p>The bank's profits rose 12.3 percent last year.</p>
</text>
